Falsifies `network_stack::ephemeral::verification::a_position_is_a_port_in_range_and_the_clock_never_runs_backwards`.

The defect: `port_at` takes the remainder modulo one more than the range, so the top position maps
past `HI`.

Expected to fail: the harness's range assertion on the port.

diff --git a/crates/network_stack/src/ephemeral.rs b/crates/network_stack/src/ephemeral.rs
